+# T12/T13 — ChatGPT evidence pass, 18 Sep 2026
+
+**Objective:** Identify Aaron Caton's parents, prioritizing records that can name a parent or resolve the Fauquier Thomas identities.
+
+**Status:** PARTIAL — no acquired record names Aaron's father or mother.
+
+**Repository baseline:** `main` at `8af46cc77d6a993a7330a2427db8c209bc6d9233` (BRIEF state through C197).
