+**RECORD:** Fauquier County Board of Overseers of the Poor Minutes, 1804–1845.  
+**LOCATOR:** Library of Virginia, Fauquier Reel 116; finding-aid barcode 1125621.  
+**FINDING AID:** https://arvasarchive.org/catalog/vi_vi02514  
